    "slot": "fresh",
    "bite": {
     "id": "steel-sport-asks-slipped-again",
     "title": "Steel sport asks slipped again in August, and the accepted prices did not",
     "topic": "market",
     "body": "Asking prices on the four steel sport references we track fell for a third straight month on Calibre, down a further two per cent against July. What did not move is what those watches actually sold for: accepted offers held within a percentage point of where they sat in June. The gap is the story. Sellers are still opening high and meeting the market on the way down, which lengthens the time a listing sits without changing the number it eventually closes at. Full sets continue to close that gap fastest.",
     "author": "Priya Raman",
     "date": "September 6, 2026",
